ions", "created_at": "2022-02-15T12:15:42Z", "repo": "salamander-v1", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ca2ef139fe51d0d338d0895de630c263c6f582f4", "message": "minor tweak", "created_at": "2022-02-15T11:51:21Z", "repo": "salamander-v1", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "12d6074bf5b169a11b5d9aa9e15133cebe0a4feb", "message": "Add provisional utils", "created_at": "2022-02-15T11:43:58Z", "repo": "salamander-v1", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "36d23ee505346f25d8621f77809e28eeccaa29ab", "message": "update readme for accuracy", "created_at": "2022-02-14T09:19:20Z", "repo": "salamander-v1", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "54df63366e1e49bb92b84ed861b13d688c2c551c", "message": "remove unneeded line", "created_at": "2022-02-14T07:18:19Z", "repo": "salamander-v1", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e11a1e600613050dd0578ebbc0647338c04cb1bd", "message": "fix logical ordering and use sys.implementation", "created_at": "2022-02-04T19:01:09Z", "repo": "salamander-v1", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "52720d83a6fda6bd4eed2f0171ad640acd1cbdd5", "message": "Prevent implementation based issues\n\n- due to minimum python versioning at this time, this is preventative,\n  not reactive to current issues in this code, I was merely reminded of\n  it when it became an issue in another code base I maintain, and would\n  rather take a preventative measure now and revisit this when python\n  version compatiblity allows it to be more relevent.\n\n- open to improving support for other implementations at a time when it\n  is possible. Current known potential blockers are numba, hyperscan, apsw.\n  Additionally, a different set of dependencies should be installed for\n  aiohttp on pypy. This may not be accurate when revisiting.\n\n- See: https://github.com/pyston/pyston/issues/39 for details on pyston detection being different.", "created_at": "2022-02-04T18:42:42Z", "repo": "salamander-v1", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "86dece2bf4d7a0e86c90567f212963536ad6bc28", "message": "Add manifest info for existing extensions", "created_at": "2022-01-06T10:40:09Z", "repo": "salamander-v1", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4446b7d1113a136b4698c9195904716b2c61618a", "message": "Bump apsw version", "created_at": "2022-01-06T09:03:36Z", "repo": "salamander-v1", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ad27f026dde42f5cb2ee54ef533fb2677ee87913", "message": "Add `ExtensionManifest` class\n\nRelated to: #71", "created_at": "2022-01-02T02:06:51Z", "repo": "salamander-v1", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7d662fad85a74389109b45f649119d0aef52a65e", "message": "Disallow partial matching on timedelta parsing\n\n- Explicit start/end of match as part of regex\n- Fullmatch was another option available, but was not used; see\n  discussion of potential alternative regex engines by default in future\n  in discord for details", "created_at": "2022-01-02T00:05:17Z", "repo": "salamander-v1", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "42106d7488fb52ff0fcee02f4621e9e406487592", "message": "remove unused relativedatetime parser", "created_at": "2022-01-02T00:04:01Z", "repo": "salamander-v1", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "98578aa1974a0d7778569ac9d822f13614d31269", "message": "update format_list", "created_at": "2021-12-28T13:56:56Z", "repo": "salamander-v1", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c29949b5c020d59e1e567c988560d8233924337b", "message": "further bank fix", "created_at": "2021-12-28T12:59:26Z", "repo": "salamander-v1